        <mxCell id="p4-note" value="The amount is snapshotted onto the payment row, exactly as cart_items.unit_price snapshots the price — a later price change must never move a completed payment.&lt;br&gt;The provider token is referenced, never copied. payment_events is insert-only: no UPDATE, no DELETE, provider payloads stored with card data redacted." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#B9C1BD;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5C6764;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="p4-1">
